an class=\"st0\">\" │ \"</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span>r<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"st0\">\" │<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>n <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"nu0\">2</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"└────────────────────┴─────────┘<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    show<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw2\">false</span> not_eq <span class=\"kw2\">false</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\"false not_eq false\"</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    show<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw2\">false</span> not_eq <span class=\"kw2\">true</span> , <span class=\"st0\">\"false not_eq true \"</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    show<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw2\">true</span>  not_eq <span class=\"kw2\">false</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\"true  not_eq false\"</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    show<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw2\">true</span>  not_eq <span class=\"kw2\">true</span> , <span class=\"st0\">\"true  not_eq true \"</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">2</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>┌────────────────────┬─────────┐\n│ false not_eq false │  false  │\n│ false not_eq true  │  true   │\n│ true  not_eq false │  true   │\n│ true  not_eq true  │